{"lyrics":"[00:00.68]I can make it sell\n[00:12.00](Enviyon On The Mix)\n[00:12.40]Ooh, her thrill\n[00:12.74]Chillin' with the crew, icy all my jewels\n[00:15.06]Bad bitch, and I got her wetter than a pool (I can make it sell)\n[00:18.12]I do what I do, run up, don't be fooled\n[00:21.28].40 on my hip and it's gon' do what it do\n[00:24.10]Almost made the news, but I hit the cruise (Cruise)\n[00:27.04]Police came around, so you know I couldn't lose (I can make it sell)\n[00:30.64]I do what I do, I do what I do, I do what I do, and I do it better than you (Ooh, her thrill)\n[00:35.94]I get so high, I don't ever see low\n[00:38.30]Ballin' in the paint, finna hit a elbow\n[00:41.34]Yeah, I get the green, I ain't talkin' CeeLo (Ooh, her thrill)\n[00:44.34]Yeah, I play piano, and I got the C-notes (I can make it sell)\n[00:47.52]Pull up on his ass, choppa make him hit low\n[00:50.32]Hit low, low like a limbo, let's go (Ooh, her thrill)\n[00:54.48]Run up on me I blow, .40, make a nigga call the Five-O\n[01:00.00]I can make it sell (Ooh, her thrill)\n[01:03.30]Ballin' on these niggas, boy, I'm 'bout to shoot a free throw\n[01:06.46]Headshots, leg shots like I'm D. Rose\n[01:09.36]Steal a bike, GTA, feel like Deebo (I can make it sell)\n[01:12.04]Chillin' with the crew, icy all my jewels\n[01:15.06]Bad bitch, and I got her wetter than a pool\n[01:18.20]I do what I do, run up, don't be fooled\n[01:21.28].40 on my hip and it's gon' do what it do\n[01:24.08]Almost made the news, but I hit the cruise (Cruise)\n[01:27.04]Police came around, so you know I couldn't lose (I can make it sell)\n[01:30.20]I do what I do, I do what I do, I do what I do, and I do it better than you (Ooh, her thrill)\n[01:36.14]I can never lose, that's just what I do\n[01:39.08]Me and my crew just walked in the room\n[01:41.94]A-Acid and shrooms, I'm fly like a broom\n[01:45.08]Run up, get hit, boy, you dirty like broom (I can make it sell)\n[01:48.08]Gucci on my shirt, Goyard on my belt\n[01:51.08]Feel